# Same contract as omnibench/results/.gitignore: only the rows that ARE the
# result are committable. Replay .npz files and controller breadcrumbs are
# regenerable from the vendored dataset + the world + run.py (~84 min for the
# full 550), so they stay local. A campaign leaves ~32 MB of binary here that
# changes every run; that is not a thing to put in git.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!runs.jsonl
!scores.json
